  "content_md": "![[747gyjnghcqmd5qb4wqxq3pajv]]\n\nOh that is delightful\n",
  "content_html": "<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"747gyjnghcqmd5qb4wqxq3pajv\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://blyg.aneeshsathe.com/\">\n<p>While reading the Appleby book, Relentless  Revolution I learned that the term “lean” originated when Japan had to adopt just in time manufacturing and work in cramped spaces. The term <em>lean production</em> was used as a contrast with America’s <em>mass production</em>.</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"710nwqzyx79sacp4zcqaw4e1px\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://caseyjr.org/blyg/\">\n<p>300 pound middle manager who preaches lean management</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n<p>Oh that is delightful</p>\n",
